2. PyXtal — https://github.com/MaterSim/PyXtal  (MIT)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The rod-group (1D-periodic) symmetry-operation tables
(include/cppcrystal/data/rod_group_tables.hpp, generated by
tools/transcribe_rod_groups.py) are transcribed from PyXtal's rod-group data.
The object-oriented, generation-focused API design is also influenced by PyXtal.
These portions are governed by the following license:

