--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
3. Element covalent radii
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The element covalent-radius data (tools/element_data.csv, compiled into
include/cppcrystal/data/element_tables.hpp) is taken from:

    B. Cordero et al., "Covalent radii revisited," Dalton Trans., 2008,
    2832-2838. doi:10.1039/B801115J

Scientific data values are not subject to copyright; the citation is provided
for attribution.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
4. kokkos/mdspan — https://github.com/kokkos/mdspan  (Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

include/cppcrystal/third_party/mdspan.hpp is the single-header reference
implementation of std::mdspan (P0009 and follow-ups) from the kokkos/mdspan
project, vendored verbatim at the commit recorded in
tools/mdspan_vendor_diff.py. It is bound into this library only through
include/cppcrystal/core/mdspan.hpp. It is governed by the Apache License,
Version 2.0, with LLVM exceptions:

    Copyright (2022) National Technology & Engineering Solutions of Sandia,
    LLC (NTESS). Under the terms of Contract DE-NA0003525 with NTESS, the
    U.S. Government retains certain rights in this software.

    Part of Kokkos, under the Apache License v2.0 with LLVM Exceptions.
    See https://kokkos.org/LICENSE for license information.
